      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The similarities are definitely interesting.</p><p>I don&#39;t know if there are other&#39;s of Kaargra&#39;s race around or not, we don&#39;t see any, but the style is remarkably similar in poise and facial structure. &nbsp;I doubt it would be Kaargra though.</p><p>My initial thoughts are it would be coincidence, and the gill-like slots are noticably missing from the Relic Spirit.</p><p>However it could be possible that relic spirits come from her people, or are made from them or something. &nbsp;Nightmist makes no appearance in the Warfang or Title deck, so there&#39;s no sign she would be there to question it.</p><p>It is an interesting observation, and welcome to the forums.</p>",
